---
import Footer from "../components/layout/Footer.astro"
import Header from "../components/layout/Header.astro"
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"

const orderSteps = [
  { number: "01", title: "Konsultasi", fullTitle: "Konsultasi Kebutuhan", desc: "Jumlah, fungsi pakaian, bahan, dan target waktu dibahas di awal.", icon: "chat", phase: "01 · Inisiasi" },
  { number: "02", title: "Form Pesanan", fullTitle: "Formulir Pesanan", desc: "Rincian ukuran, warna, serta penempatan identitas dicatat.", icon: "document", phase: "01 · Inisiasi" },
  { number: "03", title: "Penawaran", fullTitle: "Penawaran & Scope", desc: "Harga dan ruang lingkup pekerjaan dikirim untuk diperiksa.", icon: "calculator", phase: "01 · Inisiasi" },
  { number: "04", title: "DP 60%", fullTitle: "Pembayaran Awal", desc: "DP 60% menempatkan pesanan ke antrean kerja resmi.", icon: "wallet", phase: "02 · Persetujuan" },
  { number: "05", title: "Spesifikasi", fullTitle: "Spesifikasi Produksi", desc: "Detail yang disepakati dirangkum sebagai acuan tim produksi.", icon: "clipboard", phase: "02 · Persetujuan" },
  { number: "06", title: "ACC Desain", fullTitle: "Desain & ACC Final", desc: "Visual serta detail akhir dikunci sebelum kain dipotong.", icon: "check-circle", phase: "02 · Persetujuan" },
  { number: "07", title: "Produksi", fullTitle: "Proses Produksi", desc: "Pemotongan, bordir, dan jahit berjalan sesuai spesifikasi.", icon: "scissors", phase: "03 · Eksekusi" },
  { number: "08", title: "QC Check", fullTitle: "Pemeriksaan Mutu", desc: "Ukuran, jumlah, jahitan, dan identitas diperiksa per batch.", icon: "search", phase: "03 · Eksekusi" },
  { number: "09", title: "Pengiriman", fullTitle: "Pelunasan & Kirim", desc: "Barang dikirim setelah hasil pemeriksaan & pelunasan selesai.", icon: "truck", phase: "03 · Eksekusi" },
] as const
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Layanan & Portofolio Roller Customize"
  description="Dari konsultasi material, katalog workshirt, tabel ukuran, sampai proses produksi batch, Roller Customize menjaga seragam Anda tetap presisi."
  path="/layanan"
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="service-hero" aria-labelledby="service-title">
      <p>Layanan & spesifikasi</p>
      <h1 id="service-title">Workshirt kustom, dengan rincian yang bisa diperiksa sebelum produksi.</h1>
      <div>Katalog di bawah memuat bahan, biaya, ukuran, dan urutan kerja yang kami gunakan.</div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION: PRODUCT CATALOG & PRICELIST -->
    <section class="catalog" aria-labelledby="catalog-title">
      <div class="catalog__inner">
        <div class="catalog__intro">
          <span class="catalog__tag">Katalog utama</span>
          <h2 id="catalog-title">Custom Workshirt</h2>
          <p class="catalog__moq"><strong>Pesanan minimum:</strong> 24 pcs <span class="catalog__moq-sub">Pesanan di bawah jumlah minimum dikenakan tambahan Rp15.000–Rp35.000 per pcs.</span></p>
          
          <div class="catalog__specs">
            <h3>Spesifikasi standar</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Model:</strong> Lengan Pendek</li>
              <li><strong>Desain:</strong> Termasuk 2 titik bordir komputer</li>
              <li><strong>Potongan:</strong> Reguler Cut</li>
              <li><strong>Ukuran Standar:</strong> S sampai XL</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="catalog__notes">
            <h3>Ketentuan tambahan</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Kenaikan ukuran di atas XL dikenakan tambahan +Rp5.000 per tingkat size (XXL, 3XL, dst).</li>
              <li>Bordir punggung ukuran besar (di atas 27 x 15 cm) dikenakan biaya sesuai dengan kerumitan desain.</li>
              <li>Aksen scotlight/reflector, velcro, dan kombinasi kain dihitung berdasarkan kerumitan produksi.</li>
              <li>Penggunaan resleting tambahan disesuaikan dengan merk yang diminta.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="catalog__pricing-panel">
          <div class="pricing-card">
            <h3>Harga bahan utama</h3>
            <div class="pricing-list">
              <div class="pricing-item">
                <span>American Drill</span>
                <strong>Rp100.000 <small>/ pcs</small></strong>
              </div>
              <div class="pricing-item">
                <span>Nagata Drill</span>
                <strong>Rp120.000 <small>/ pcs</small></strong>
              </div>
              <div class="pricing-item">
                <span>Tropical</span>
                <strong>Rp145.000 <small>/ pcs</small></strong>
              </div>
              <div class="pricing-item">
                <span>Ripstop</span>
                <strong>Rp145.000 <small>/ pcs</small></strong>
              </div>
              <div class="pricing-item">
                <span>Bahan Lain (By Request)</span>
                <strong>Sesuai Material</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="variations-card">
            <h3>Variasi dan biaya tambahan</h3>
            <div class="variations-grid">
              <div class="var-item"><span>Up Size (&gt; XL)</span><strong>+Rp5.000</strong></div>
              <div class="var-item"><span>Boxy Cut</span><strong>+Rp7.000</strong></div>
              <div class="var-item"><span>Lengan Panjang</span><strong>+Rp10.000</strong></div>
              <div class="var-item"><span>Reflector / Scotlight</span><strong>Rp3.000 - Rp10.000</strong></div>
              <div class="var-item"><span>Velcro (Perekat)</span><strong>Rp3.000 - Rp10.000</strong></div>
              <div class="var-item"><span>Resleting Custom</span><strong>Rp7.000 - Rp20.000</strong></div>
              <div class="var-item"><span>Kombinasi Warna</span><strong>Rp5.000 - Rp20.000</strong></div>
              <div class="var-item"><span>Bordir Tambahan</span><strong>Rp5.000 - Rp30.000</strong></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION: PROSEDUR KERJA (S-CURVE ROADMAP FLOW) -->
    <section class="flow" aria-labelledby="flow-title">
      <div class="flow__inner">
        <header class="flow__header">
          <div class="flow__header-main">
            <span class="flow__tag">Prosedur Kerja</span>
            <h2 id="flow-title">Roadmap Produksi Seragam.</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="flow__lede">9 tahap transparan dan terukur dari diskusi awal hingga produk tiba di tempat Anda.</p>
        </header>

        <!-- S-CURVE ROADMAP TRACK -->
        <div class="roadmap">
          <!-- ROW 1 (01 -> 02 -> 03) -->
          <div class="roadmap__row roadmap__row--1">
            <div class="roadmap__step">
              <div class="roadmap__node">
                <span class="roadmap__num">01</span>
                <div class="roadmap__icon">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="roadmap__card">
                <span class="roadmap__tag">Fase 1 · Inisiasi</span>
                <h4>Konsultasi Kebutuhan</h4>
                <p>Jumlah, fungsi pakaian, bahan, dan target waktu dibahas di awal.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap__arrow roadmap__arrow--right" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap__step">
              <div class="roadmap__node">
                <span class="roadmap__num">02</span>
                <div class="roadmap__icon">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="roadmap__card">
                <span class="roadmap__tag">Fase 1 · Inisiasi</span>
                <h4>Formulir Pesanan</h4>
                <p>Rincian ukuran, warna, serta penempatan identitas dicatat.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap__arrow roadmap__arrow--right" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap__step">
              <div class="roadmap__node">
                <span class="roadmap__num">03</span>
                <div class="roadmap__icon">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2"/><line x1="8" y1="6" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="16" y1="14" x2="16" y2="18"/><path d="M8 10h.01M12 10h.01M16 10h.01M8 14h.01M12 14h.01M8 18h.01M12 18h.01"/></svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="roadmap__card">
                <span class="roadmap__tag">Fase 1 · Inisiasi</span>
                <h4>Penawaran & Scope</h4>
                <p>Harga dan ruang lingkup pekerjaan dikirim untuk diperiksa.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- LOOP TURN 1 (Right side curve down to Row 2) -->
          <div class="roadmap__turn roadmap__turn--right" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="roadmap__turn-arc"></div>
            <div class="roadmap__turn-arrow">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- ROW 2 (04 <- 05 <- 06 on desktop, 04 -> 05 -> 06 on mobile) -->
          <div class="roadmap__row roadmap__row--2">
            <div class="roadmap__step roadmap__step--04">
              <div class="roadmap__node">
                <span class="roadmap__num">04</span>
                <div class="roadmap__icon">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="2" y1="10" x2="22" y2="10"/></svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="roadmap__card">
                <span class="roadmap__tag">Fase 2 · Persetujuan</span>
                <h4>Pembayaran Awal (DP)</h4>
                <p>DP 60% menempatkan pesanan ke antrean kerja resmi.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap__arrow roadmap__arrow--left roadmap__arrow--2-1" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap__step roadmap__step--05">
              <div class="roadmap__node">
                <span class="roadmap__num">05</span>
                <div class="roadmap__icon">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/><rect x="8" y="2" width="8" height="4" rx="1"/></svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="roadmap__card">
                <span class="roadmap__tag">Fase 2 · Persetujuan</span>
                <h4>Spesifikasi Produksi</h4>
                <p>Detail yang disepakati dirangkum sebagai acuan tim produksi.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap__arrow roadmap__arrow--left roadmap__arrow--2-2" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap__step roadmap__step--06">
              <div class="roadmap__node">
                <span class="roadmap__num">06</span>
                <div class="roadmap__icon">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="roadmap__card">
                <span class="roadmap__tag">Fase 2 · Persetujuan</span>
                <h4>Desain & ACC Final</h4>
                <p>Visual serta detail akhir dikunci sebelum kain dipotong.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- LOOP TURN 2 (Left side curve down to Row 3) -->
          <div class="roadmap__turn roadmap__turn--left" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="roadmap__turn-arc"></div>
            <div class="roadmap__turn-arrow">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- ROW 3 (07 -> 08 -> 09) -->
          <div class="roadmap__row roadmap__row--3">
            <div class="roadmap__step">
              <div class="roadmap__node">
                <span class="roadmap__num">07</span>
                <div class="roadmap__icon">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"/><line x1="20" y1="4" x2="8.12" y2="15.88"/><line x1="14.47" y1="14.48" x2="20" y2="20"/><line x1="8.12" y1="8.12" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="roadmap__card">
                <span class="roadmap__tag">Fase 3 · Eksekusi</span>
                <h4>Proses Produksi</h4>
                <p>Pemotongan, bordir, dan jahit berjalan sesuai spesifikasi.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap__arrow roadmap__arrow--right" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap__step">
              <div class="roadmap__node">
                <span class="roadmap__num">08</span>
                <div class="roadmap__icon">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="roadmap__card">
                <span class="roadmap__tag">Fase 3 · Eksekusi</span>
                <h4>Pemeriksaan Mutu (QC)</h4>
                <p>Ukuran, jumlah, jahitan, dan identitas diperiksa per batch.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap__arrow roadmap__arrow--right" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </div>

            <div class="roadmap__step">
              <div class="roadmap__node roadmap__node--finish">
                <span class="roadmap__num">09</span>
                <div class="roadmap__icon">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"/><polygon points="16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="roadmap__card">
                <span class="roadmap__tag roadmap__tag--finish">Selesai & Kirim 📦</span>
                <h4>Pelunasan & Kirim</h4>
                <p>Barang dikirim setelah hasil pemeriksaan & pelunasan selesai.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION: SIZE CHART TABS -->
    <section class="sizechart" aria-labelledby="sizechart-title">
      <div class="sizechart__inner">
        <div class="sizechart__header">
          <span class="sizechart__tag">Panduan Ukuran</span>
          <h2 id="sizechart-title">Panduan ukuran</h2>
          <p>Dua pola dasar yang dapat dipilih sebelum sampel dibuat.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sizechart__tabs-container">
          <div class="tab-buttons" role="tablist">
            <button class="tab-button active" data-tab="reguler" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Pola Reguler Cut</button>
            <button class="tab-button" data-tab="boxy" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Pola Boxy Cut</button>
          </div>

          <div class="tab-panels">
            <!-- TAB 1: REGULER -->
            <div class="tab-panel active" id="reguler" role="tabpanel">
              <div class="table-wrapper">
                <table>
                  <thead>
                    <tr>
                      <th>Ukuran</th>
                      <th>Panjang Badan (cm)</th>
                      <th>Lebar Dada (cm)</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr><td>S</td><td>68</td><td>50</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>M</td><td>70</td><td>52</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>L</td><td>72</td><td>54</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>XL</td><td>74</td><td>56</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>XXL</td><td>76</td><td>60</td></tr>
                    <tr class="table-add"><td>Per kenaikan size (+X)</td><td>+2</td><td>+2</td></tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- TAB 2: BOXY -->
            <div class="tab-panel" id="boxy" role="tabpanel">
              <div class="table-wrapper">
                <table>
                  <thead>
                    <tr>
                      <th>Ukuran</th>
                      <th>Panjang Badan (cm)</th>
                      <th>Lebar Dada (cm)</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr><td>S</td><td>64</td><td>52</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>M</td><td>66</td><td>54</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>L</td><td>68</td><td>56</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>XL</td><td>70</td><td>58</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>XXL</td><td>72</td><td>60</td></tr>
                    <tr class="table-add"><td>Per kenaikan size (+X)</td><td>+2</td><td>+2</td></tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="sizechart__footer">
            <p>* Panduan ukuran di atas berlaku untuk produk <strong>Kemeja & Kaos</strong>.</p>
            <p>* Celana panjang, celana pendek, dan totebag menggunakan ukuran custom dari klien.</p>
            <p>* Pola ukuran kustom khusus dikenakan biaya tambahan dan dapat mempengaruhi durasi produksi.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION: TERMS & CONDITIONS ACCORDION -->
    <section class="terms" aria-labelledby="terms-title">
      <div class="terms__inner">
        <div class="terms__header">
          <span class="terms__tag">Ketentuan kerja</span>
          <h2 id="terms-title">Sebelum pesanan dikunci</h2>
          <p>Waktu, toleransi produksi, pembayaran, dan pengiriman yang perlu disepakati.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion">
          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>1. Waktu Produksi (Production Time)</summary>
            <div class="accordion__content">
              <p>Waktu produksi normal berkisar antara 14-20 hari kerja. Hitungan ini dimulai H+1 setelah desain final disetujui secara tertulis dan pembayaran DP minimal diterima. Hari Minggu serta hari libur nasional tidak dihitung sebagai hari kerja.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>2. Toleransi Ukuran (Size Tolerance)</summary>
            <div class="accordion__content">
              <p>Terdapat toleransi perbedaan ukuran sebesar ±1–2 cm dari size chart panduan yang digunakan. Hal ini wajar dalam standar produksi jahit konveksi massal.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>3. Akurasi Warna (Color Accuracy)</summary>
            <div class="accordion__content">
              <p>Akurasi warna produk akhir berkisar 90% dari referensi digital yang diberikan. Deviasi minor disebabkan oleh perbedaan lot celupan kain dari supplier, rendering tampilan layar gadget (RGB vs CMYK), serta faktor pencahayaan saat foto produksi.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>4. Desain & Persetujuan (Design & Approval)</summary>
            <div class="accordion__content">
              <p>Proses pemotongan kain hanya dilakukan setelah lembar persetujuan desain ditandatangani/disetujui klien. Segala bentuk revisi desain tidak dapat dilakukan apabila proses produksi jahit sudah berjalan. Kesalahan akibat kelalaian file desain dari klien menjadi tanggung jawab penuh pihak pembeli.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>5. Ketentuan Pembayaran (Payment Terms)</summary>
            <div class="accordion__content">
              <p>Produksi baru akan dimasukkan antrean jahit setelah pembayaran DP (Down Payment) minimal 60% lunas. Pelunasan tagihan sisa wajib ditransfer sebelum barang dikirim dari workshop. Pembayaran yang sudah masuk tidak dapat dikembalikan dengan alasan apa pun (non-refundable).</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>6. Keterlambatan Produksi (Production Delays)</summary>
            <div class="accordion__content">
              <p>Jika terjadi kendala teknis atau antrean bahan di pabrik supplier, tim kami akan menginformasikan keterlambatan tersebut kepada Anda selambat-lambatnya H-2 sebelum tenggat waktu pengiriman yang disepakati.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>7. Pengiriman (Shipping)</summary>
            <div class="accordion__content">
              <p>Barang dikirim segera setelah pelunasan tagihan terverifikasi. Biaya pengiriman ditanggung sepenuhnya oleh customer. Keterlambatan atau kerusakan akibat kelalaian pihak ekspedisi/kurir di luar tanggung jawab kami.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>8. Pemesanan Event (Event Order)</summary>
            <div class="accordion__content">
              <p>Untuk kebutuhan seragam yang akan dipakai pada tanggal event tertentu, kami sangat menyarankan pemesanan dilakukan selambat-lambatnya H-20 sebelum tanggal pemakaian demi menghindari resiko keterlambatan ekspedisi.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="accordion__item">
            <summary>9. Klaim & Revisi (Claim & Revision)</summary>
            <div class="accordion__content">
